I'll create a self-contained HTML file that replicates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Aster" (note: the original request mentions "aders" which appears to be a typo for "Asteroids" - but I'll create a classic space shooter game in the same style). Let me build a complete arcade experience with authentic sprite designs and mechanics.

